<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge falls to 73.4123 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge falls to 73.4123 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1996-12-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge fell to 73.4123 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Saturday from 72.4500 on Friday.</p>
<p>				    Dec 14		  Dec 13</p>
<p>    tenge per dollar	  73.4123		 72.4500</p>
<p>    volume ($ million)	     4.955		   4.220</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom + 7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
